            <Info>The BS1100IP is a powerful multi-use fixture and is specially designed to be used as a strobe or blinder, thanks to the 768 SMD LEDs. The LED panel is divided in 96 sections and can flash in any colour you desire thanks to its RGB mixing system. This strobe is also equipped with a strip of 128 white SMD LEDs in the centre of the fixture, controllable in 16 different sections to create the traditional look of a strobe. The BS1100IP makes it possible to create unique colourful effects and control is easy via DMX or in stand-alone mode with automatic function. Dust and water-resistant, the IP65 rating guarantees reliable performance in any weather condition. Suitable for all kind of indoor and outdoor shows and events.</Info>
            <Info type="Revision" date="2025-01-09T13:47:41.813">BeamZ%20BS1100, Uploaded to Fixture Share.</Info>
